r Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hello.\" title=\"Hello.\">Hello.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.\" title=\"Stuck in a mammal groove.\">Stuck in a mammal groove.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_barrel_dad.\" title=\"The barrel dad.\">The barrel dad.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stay_humble.\" title=\"Stay humble.\">Stay humble.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.\" title=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut.\">Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/This_is_Trevor.\" title=\"This is Trevor.\">This is Trevor.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.\" title=\"Aquatic sewing machine.\">Aquatic sewing machine.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ve_been_a_bit_ill.\" title=\"I&#39;ve been a bit ill.\">I've been a bit ill.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clumpy_swayey_clumsy_man.\" title=\"Clumpy swayey clumsy man.\">Clumpy swayey clumsy man.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/ad/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212034256\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/ad/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034256\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/ad/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034256 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/ad/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212034256 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags..png\" data-image-name=\"A novel about Russian Gulags..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\">Lou Sanders</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hello.\" title=\"Hello.\">Hello.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.\" title=\"Stuck in a mammal groove.\">Stuck in a mammal groove.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A novel about Russian Gulags.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 15 May 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\">Lou Sanders</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A novel about Russian Gulags\" was where <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> said he expected to hear comments like that made by <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\">Joe Thomas</a>, at the end of his attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Travel_the_furthest_distance_while_making_a_constant_noise_with_your_mouth\" title=\"Travel the furthest distance while making a constant noise with your mouth\">Travel the furthest distance while making a constant noise with your mouth</a> task. A single grain of rice from the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_rice_into_the_bottle_in_the_living_room\" title=\"Get this rice into the bottle in the living room\">Get this rice into the bottle in the living room</a> task is used in the title card for the episode.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En roman om russiske Gulag-lejre', which translates as 'A novel about Russian Gulag camps'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Romaani Venäjän gulageista', which translates as 'A novel about Russian gulags'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En roman om russiske gulager', which translates as 'A novel about Russian Gulags'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_pair_of_things\" title=\"Best pair of things\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best pair of things.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_something_on_your_face_that_looks_like_a_moustache_from_a_long_distance_away\" title=\"Put something on your face that looks like a moustache from a long distance away\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put something on your face that looks like a moustache from a long distance away, but when you get up close, you realise it's something completely different to what you thought.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_rice_into_the_bottle_in_the_living_room\" title=\"Get this rice into the bottle in the living room\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get this rice into the bottle in the living room. You may only use the shopping basket and its contents to transport and deliver the rice. You may not touch the rice with anything other than the shopping basket and its contents. You may not take the bottle out of the living room.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> For accepting disqualification with grace and being a reasonable man.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tell_your_teammates_what_is_in_this_chest\" title=\"Tell your teammates what is in this chest\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Tell your teammates what is in this chest. Your teammates must not see what is in the chest. After reading the task out, you may not speak until the task is over. In the first minute, you may only use facial expressions. In the second minute, you may only make noises. In the third minute, you may only shout adjectives. From then on, you may only whisper verbs.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Travel_the_furthest_distance_while_making_a_constant_noise_with_your_mouth\" title=\"Travel the furthest distance while making a constant noise with your mouth\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Travel the furthest distance while making a constant noise with your mouth.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Say_a_species_of_bird,_eat_a_grape,_then_shout_a_competitor%27s_name\" title=\"Say a species of bird, eat a grape, then shout a competitor&#39;s name\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Say a species of bird, eat a grape, then shout a competitor's name within five seconds of hearing your own name. If you fail to say a different species of bird, pop a grape in your mouth and shout a competitor's name within five seconds of hearing your own name, you will be eliminated. You must not say any bird that has previously been said during the task.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>21</b>\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of four episodes in which the winner did not win any tasks, with the others being <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ve_sinned_again.\" title=\"I&#39;ve sinned again.\">I've sinned again.</a></span>, <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.\" title=\"Twelve blush majesty two.\">Twelve blush majesty two.</a></span>, and <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_that_on_my_gravestone.\" title=\"Put that on my gravestone.\">Put that on my gravestone.</a></span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_2_-_%22A_Novel_About_Russian_Gulags%22\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/4b/Taskmaster_-_Series_8%2C_Episode_2_-_%22A_Novel_About_Russian_Gulags%22/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003945\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_2_-_&quot;A_Novel_About_Russian_Gulags&quot;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_2_-_&quot;A_Novel_About_Russian_Gulags&quot;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 8, Episode 2 - &quot;A Novel About Russian Gulags&quot;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"